\nBoarding\nGrooming\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(918) 835-9593\nText:\n(918) 835-9593\nFax:\n(918) 835-0775\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nTue\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nWed\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nThu\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nFri\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n1:00pm\nSun\nClosed\nContact Us\nHome Away From Home\nProviding the best care for you and your pet.\nCaring for pets is our passion and something we look forward to doing every day. We believe it is important to get to know the personality of every animal so we can provide appropriate and relevant care. As we get to know your pets, we invite you to take a moment to get to know us and our team as well.\nLearn More\nClient Testimonials & Reviews\nOur staff at Sheridan Road Veterinary Clinic values feedback from our clients. Here is just a small sample of the hundreds of happy and healthy pets that we have cared for since 1978.\nSheridan Road Veterinary Clinic\n1010 N Sheridan Rd.\nTulsa\n,\nOK\n74115\nT:\n(918) 835-9593\nF:\n(918) 835-0775\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nTue\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nWed\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nThu\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nFri\n7:30am\n-\n6:00pm\nSat\n8:00am\n-\n1:00pm\nSun\nClosed\nAbout Us\nOur Team\nServices\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nTerms & Conditions\nPrivacy Policy\nContact Us\nAccessibility\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
